# Environment Configuration
#
# This application uses AWS Secrets Manager and Parameter Store for configuration.
# Only APP_ENV is required - all other config is fetched from AWS based on environment.
#
# AWS credentials below are ONLY for retrieving secrets/parameters and have limited permissions.
# Rotate these credentials regularly for security.

# Required: Environment (determines which secrets/parameters to fetch)
APP_ENV=test

# AWS Credentials for Configuration Retrieval (Limited Permissions Only)
# These are used solely to fetch secrets and parameters from AWS
# Rotate regularly - contact your admin for new credentials
APP_AWS_ACCESS_KEY=AKIA...........
APP_AWS_SECRET_KEY=3ZH..........

# Note: All other configuration (database, Redis, Twilio, Firebase, etc.) 
# is automatically loaded from AWS based on APP_ENV value.
# No need to set APP_DATABASE_URL, APP_REDIS_HOST, etc. locally.